"citation":"Botham, M.S., Middlebrook, I., Heywood, J., Harrower, C.A., Milborrow, J., Roy, D.B. (2025). United Kingdom Butterfly Monitoring Scheme: species trends 2024. NERC EDS Environmental Information Data Centre. (Dataset). https://doi.org/10.5285/4cf966ef-4d8e-48de-8368-3a68faf6fbbf",
